// Sheet `variant: Transform`, but the description ("hardens defenses,
// lends strikes celestial/infernal might") reads as a stat buff, not a
// literal species swap -- no celestial/infernal `Body` exists in the
// engine's species roster to swap into anyway. Modeled as `Reckless`
// (damage-up), same substitution battle_transformation.ron uses for a
// comparable martial-empowerment buff, rather than forcing a body-swap
// this spell's own flavor doesn't really call for.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    cast_duration: 0.15,
    recover_duration: 0.25,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Reckless, data: BuffData(strength: 0.3, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 115.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 6 spell -> min_level 36, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(36)),
    ),
)
